            "review_title": "Review at Thanh Thanh Juice Shop",
            "review_text": "Stewart\nFort Saskatchewan, Canada232 contributions\n0\nFantastic refreshing drink\nJan 2018 • Couples\nAfter a day of shopping we saw fruit drinks and went for a refresher. I had the banana coffee drink and wife had strawberry. We lounged until finished and actually bought another. Not because the drinks were small but because they were so refreshing. Great stop with a drink for 30,000dg.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 24, 2018",
